as Barry Steakfries! Dodge zappers, missiles, and laser beams while collecting coins.", type: "jetpack", url: "https://www.gamepix.com/play/jetpack-joyride", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "750K", controls: "Spacebar / Up Arrow or Click to Fly", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "super-smash-bros", title: "Super Smash Bros N64", category: "Action", description: "The legendary Nintendo 64 crossover brawler! Fight as Mario, Link, Pikachu, and Donkey Kong.", type: "nes_n64_emulator", emulatorType: "n64", romUrl: "https://rawcdn.githack.com/a456pur/seraph/ae2fcc6d6a9cd051654fcc0519080db1f79cf2a7/games/supersmashbros/supersmashbros.zip", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 5.0, plays: "980K", controls: "WASD Movement, Z/X/C/V Attacks, Enter Start", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "slope-game", title: "Slope", category: "Arcade", description: "Drive a ball down a steep neon 3D obstacle course at breakneck speed!", type: "slope", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "500K", controls: "A / D or Left / Right Arrows to Steer", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "color-puzzles", title: "Color Puzzles", category: "Puzzle", description: "Shift color frequencies to pass through matching energy barriers, activate light bridges, and solve 6 puzzle chambers.", type: "color-puzzles", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 5.0, plays: "620K", controls: "1,2,3 or C to Shift Color, Space/W Jump", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "the-chroma-incident", title: "The Chroma Incident", category: "Puzzle", description: "Navigate through colored laser grids and energy fields in this puzzle adventure.", type: "chroma-incident", url: "https://www.gamepix.com/play/the-chroma-incident", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "410K", controls: "WASD / Mouse to play", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "2048-frost", title: "2048 Frost Edition", category: "Puzzle", description: "Slide and merge matching ice tiles together to reach the 2048 tile!", type: "2048", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "250K", controls: "Arrow Keys or WASD to slide tiles", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "flappy-bird", title: "Flappy Bird", category: "Skill", description: "Guide the bird through dangerous pipe gaps with precise one-button timing!", type: "flappy", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "620K", controls: "Tap Spacebar or Click to flap wings", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "retro-snake", title: "Icy Snake Classic", category: "Arcade", description: "Eat glowing ice apples, grow longer, and don't hit your tail!", type: "snake", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "195K", controls: "Arrow keys or WASD to steer", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "crossy-road", title: "Crossy Road 3D", category: "Arcade", description: "Cross endless busy roads, train tracks, and rivers in voxel 3D!", type: "url", url: "https://www.gamepix.com/play/crossy-road", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "820K", controls: "Arrow Keys / Space to Hop", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "paper-io-3d", title: "Paper.io 3D", category: "Strategy", description: "Claim as much 3D territory as possible in Paper.io 3D!", type: "paperio", url: "https://paperio.site/3d/", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "450K", controls: "Arrow Keys, WASD or Mouse to steer", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "tetris-frost", title: "Tetris Ice Blocks", category: "Puzzle", description: "Clear full horizontal lines by rotating falling ice blocks!", type: "tetris", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "320K", controls: "Left/Right Move, Up Rotate, Down Fast, Space Drop, C Hold", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "cookie-clicker", title: "Cookie Clicker Frost", category: "Skill", description: "Click the giant cookie, hire grandmas, and build your baking empire!", type: "cookie", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "890K", controls: "Left Click giant cookie to bake", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "moto-x3m", title: "Moto X3M Bike Race", category: "Racing", description: "Awesome motocross stunt racing with 25 intense levels!", type: "moto-x3m", url: "https://motox3m.org/", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "600K", controls: "Up Accelerate, Down Brake, Left/Right Tilt", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "chess-classic", title: "Classic Chess 3D", category: "Strategy", description: "Test your strategic skills against smart AI difficulty levels!", type: "chess", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "140K", controls: "Click piece to move", featured: false, popular: false }, { id: "drift-hunters", title: "Drift Hunters", category: "Racing", description: "Ultimate 3D car drifting simulator with realistic physics, fully customizable tuner cars, and huge track maps.", type: "drift-hunters", url: "https://drifthunters2.io/", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "450K", controls: "WASD Drive, Space Handbrake", featured: false, popular: true }, { id: "drift-hunters-max", title: "Drift Hunters MAX", category: "Racing", description: "Experience next-level 3D drifting action with expanded tracks, realistic tuning, and high-performance cars.", type: "drift-hunters-max", url: "https://drifthuntersmax.io/", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 5.0, plays: "890K", controls: "WASD Drive, Space Handbrake, C Camera", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "final-fantasy", title: "Final Fantasy NES", category: "RPG", description: "Embark on the epic classic NES Warriors of Light RPG quest!", type: "nes_n64_emulator", emulatorType: "nes", romUrl: "https://rawcdn.githack.com/bubbls/UGS-file-encryption/c99c02b28ea1531fb40611092887d0aa9db97712/Final%20Fantasy%20(USA).zip", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 5.0, plays: "640K", controls: "Arrow keys Move, Z Confirm, X Back, Enter Start", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "roblox-experimental", title: "Roblox (now.gg Cloud)", category: "Cloud Gaming", description: "Play Roblox online in your browser via now.gg cloud web player with zero downloads!", type: "roblox", url: "https://now.gg/apps/a/19900/b.html", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "1.2M", controls: "WASD Move, Space Jump, Mouse Look", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "rocket-goal", title: "Rocket Goal", category: "Sports", description: "Fast-paced vehicular soccer and rocket-powered car goal battles!", type: "rocket-goal", url: "https://rocketgoal.io/", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.9, plays: "520K", controls: "WASD Drive, Space Boost / Jump, Mouse Steering", featured: true, popular: true }, { id: "2d-rocket-league", title: "2D Rocket League", category: "Sports", description: "2D vehicular soccer action created with GameMaker Studio! Drive, boost, and score goals.", type: "2d-rocket-league", thumbnail: "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg", rating: 4.8, plays: "450K", controls: "Arrow keys / WASD to drive, Click canvas if key input is lost", featured: true, popular: true } ];
// App State let customGames = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('frost_custom_games') || '[]'); let gamesList = [...baseCatalog, ...customGames]; let activeCategory = 'All'; let activeSort = 'popular'; let searchQuery = ''; let favorites = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('frost_favorites') || '[]'); let activeGame = null; let snowEnabled = true;
// Render Game Grid function renderGames() { const grid = document.getElementById('gamesGrid'); grid.innerHTML = '';
let filtered = gamesList.filter(g => { const matchCat = activeCategory === 'All' || (activeCategory === 'Favorites' &amp;&amp; favorites.includes(g.id)) || (activeCategory === 'GN Math' &amp;&amp; (g.isGnMath || (g.tags &amp;&amp; g.tags.includes('gn-math')) || g.category === 'GN Math')) || g.category === activeCategory; const q = searchQuery.toLowerCase().trim(); const matchQuery = !q || g.title.toLowerCase().includes(q) || g.description.toLowerCase().includes(q) || (g.category &amp;&amp; g.category.toLowerCase().includes(q)); return matchCat &amp;&amp; matchQuery; });
// Sorting filtered.sort((a, b) => { if (activeSort === 'popular') return (b.popular ? 1 : 0) - (a.popular ? 1 : 0); if (activeSort === 'rating') return b.rating - a.rating; if (activeSort === 'alphabetical') return a.title.localeCompare(b.title); if (activeSort === 'newest') return (b.isCustom ? 1 : 0) - (a.isCustom ? 1 : 0); return 0; });
if (filtered.length === 0) { grid.innerHTML = ` <div class="col-span-full py-16 text-center text-sky-300/70"> <p class="text-lg font-bold">No games found</p> <p class="text-xs mt-1">Try resetting your search query or filter category</p> </div> `; } else { filtered.forEach(game => { const isFav = favorites.includes(game.id); const card = document.createElement('div'); card.className = "game-card tn-sheen cursor-pointer flex flex-col group"; card.onclick = () => openGame(game);
const isMinecraft = (game.type === 'minecraft') || (game.type === 'skyfactory') || (game.id &amp;&amp; (game.id.toLowerCase().includes('minecraft') || game.id.toLowerCase().includes('eaglercraft') || game.id.toLowerCase().includes('skyfactory'))) || (game.title &amp;&amp; (game.title.toLowerCase().includes('minecraft') || game.title.toLowerCase().includes('eaglercraft') || game.title.toLowerCase().includes('skyfactory'))) || (game.category &amp;&amp; game.category.toLowerCase().includes('minecraft')); const minecraftPhotoSrc = "/minecraft_logo.jpg"; const isGn = !isMinecraft &amp;&amp; (game.isGnMath || (game.tags &amp;&amp; game.tags.includes('gn-math')) || game.category === 'GN Math'); const gnPhotoSrc = "https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg";
const thumbSrc = isMinecraft ? (game.thumbnail &amp;&amp; game.thumbnail !== 'https://i.ibb.co/JF2kVVLZ/IMG-1638.jpg' ? game.thumbnail : minecraftPhotoSrc) : (isGn ? gnPhotoSrc : game.thumbnail);
card.innerHTML = ` <div class="thumb aspect-video w-full bg-slate-900"> <img src="${thumbSrc}" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='${game.thumbnail}';" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.08] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out" alt="${game.title}" loading="lazy" /> <div class="absolute top-2.5 left-2.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 z-10"> <span class="glow-chip rating">★ ${game.rating}</span> ${game.isCustom ? `<span class="glow-chip custom">✦ CUSTOM</span>` : ''} </div> <button onclick="toggleFav(event, '${game.id}')" class="absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 z-10 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-950/80 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-lg leading-none flex items-center justify-center transition-transform hover:scale-110"> <span class="${isFav ? 'text-amber-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(252,211,77,0.9)]' : 'text-sky-200/60'}">★</span> </button> <div class="play-orb z-10"> <span class="play-orb-ring"></span> <span class="play-orb-core"> <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-current translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg> </span> </div> <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 z-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-2 pointer-events-none"> <div class="min-w-0"> <div class="text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-sky-300/80">${game.category}</div> <h3 class="font-black text-[15px] text-white truncate drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]">${game.title}</h3> </div> </div> </div> <div class="p-3.5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3"> <p class="text-[11.5px] text-sky-100/70 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">${game.description}</p> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] pt-2.5 border-t border-white/5"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sky-300/70 font-mono"> <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>${game.plays || '100K'}</span> <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>1080p</span> </div> <span class="text-sky-200 font-black tracking-wider group-hover:text-sky-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">PLAY ▸</span> </div> </div> `; grid.appendChild(card); }); }
const favBadge = document.getElementById('favBadgeCount'); if (favBadge) favBadge.innerText = favorites.length; const heroTotal = document.getElementById('heroTotalGames'); if (heroTotal) heroTotal.innerText = gamesList.length; const homeStat = document.getElementById('homeStatGames'); if (homeStat) homeStat.innerText = gamesList.length; }
function selectCategory(cat, btnElem) { activeCategory = cat; document.querySelectorAll('.cat-btn').forEach(b => { b.className = "cat-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold transition-all border bg-slate-900/80 text-sky-200 border-sky-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800"; }); btnElem.className = "cat-btn is-active px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold transition-all border bg-sky-500 text-slate-950 border-sky-400 shadow-md"; renderGames(); }
function onSortChange(val) { activeSort = val; renderGames(); }
function onSearchInput() { searchQuery = document.getElementById('searchInput').value; renderGames(); }
function resetSearch() { searchQuery = ''; document.getElementById('searchInput').value = ''; activeCategory = 'All'; switchTab('home'); renderGames(); }
function toggleFav(e, gameId) { e.stopPropagation(); if (favorites.includes(gameId)) { favorites = favorites.filter(id => id !== gameId); } else { favorites.push(gameId); } localStorage.setItem('frost_favorites', JSON.stringify(favorites)); renderGames(); }
function toggleFavoritesFilter() { switchTab('games'); activeCategory = activeCategory === 'Favorites' ? 'All' : 'Favorites'; renderGames(); }
function switchTab(tab) { const views = { home: 'viewHome', games: 'viewGames', proxy: 'viewProxy', linkcheck: 'viewLinkcheck' }; Object.entries(views).forEach(([key, id]) => { const el = document.getElementById(id); if (el) el.classList.toggle('hidden', key !== tab); });
// Top navigation pills styling const topBase = "top-tab-btn px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-[13px] font-medium flex items-center gap-2 transition-all border"; const topActive = { home: " bg-white/10 text-white border-white/25", games: " bg-white/10 text-white border-white/25", proxy: " bg-white/10 text-white border-white/25", linkcheck: " bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-200 border-emerald-400/50 shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/10", }; const topIdle = " bg-transparent text-sky-100/60 border-white/10 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20"; ['home', 'games', 'proxy', 'linkcheck'].forEach(k => { const btnId = 'topTab' + k.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + k.slice(1); const btn = document.getElementById(btnId); if (btn) btn.className = topBase + (k === tab ? topActive[k] : topIdle); });
